<p>Hi <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>

<p>Your registration status for the following voyage has been updated:</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Voyage</th><td><%= @sailing.purpose %></td></tr>
  <tr><th>Departs</th><td><%= @sailing.departs_date %> <%= @sailing.departs_time %></td></tr>
  <tr><th>Previous Status</th><td><%= @old_status %></td></tr>
  <tr><th>New Status</th><td><%= @new_status %></td></tr>
</table>

<em>Remember to arrive 1 hour before departure for sails to help get the boat ready.</em>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact us.</p>
